include init.mod
variable up equal 4e-06
variable atomjiggle equal 1.0e-5
units metal
variable cfac equal 1.0e-4
variable cunits string GPa
variable etol equal 1.0e-8
variable ftol equal 1.0e-12
variable maxiter equal 0.0
variable maxeval equal 50000
variable dmax equal 1.0e-2
boundary p p p
read_data B0_12_minimized.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (-0.011980537 0.0037294226 0.0039343176) to (17.611981 17.596271 17.596066) with tilt (1.0772325e-15 1.0772074e-15 1.0772074e-15)
  2 by 2 by 1 MPI processor grid
